/2d-game-artist/ZOjKN3","description_html":"<div><p><strong><em>Do you want to be part of creating fantastic, unique and entertaining iGaming experiences in a competitive global market?</em></strong><strong><em>We are looking for a talented Game Artist with a strong passion for bringing life, entertainment and excitement to our growing games portfolio.</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>ELK is a leading developer in the iGaming industry, known for our innovative, visually stunning, and critically acclaimed game titles and IPs. We push the boundaries of gameplay and visual fidelity, setting new standards in the iGaming world.</em></strong></p><h3><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><strong>About the role</strong></span></h3><p>We take great pride in creating and offering our players a wide range of different art styles and themes in our games. As a Game Artist, you\u2019ll take on the exciting challenge of transforming early concept art into pixel-perfect final assets, while also crafting original concepts and artwork from the ground up.</p><p>A typical work week as an Game Artist can consist of:</p><p><strong>Asset Creation: </strong>Craft a diverse array of high-quality 2D game assets, UI element designs and awesome, polished headlines (typography) prepared for seamless handover to our expert animators. Your sharp eye for composition, color, perspective, and lighting will be critical in ensuring the highest standard of work.</p><p><strong>Polishing Assets to Perfection\u00a0</strong>with a strong focus on material definition, lighting, realism, and depth.</p><p><strong>Collaborate Across Disciplines: </strong>Work closely with other artists, animators and programmers to collaboratively build \u201cbest in class\u201d iGames.</p><p><strong>Communication: </strong>Partner with the Art Director and Creative Director to follow the unique art style of each game. Be open to feedback and take the initiative to independently enhance and perfect your work, while still ensuring it aligns with the creative vision.</p><p><strong>Innovation:</strong> Push the boundaries of what is possible in the realms of iGames to create visually stunning and memorable experiences.</p><h3><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><strong>Who are you?</strong></span></h3><p>We believe you are a passionate artist with an eye for details and the urge and ideas to make the best looking iGaming experiences ever. You are creative and innovative and aim to find solutions which maximize the game experience in relation to the technical limitations. You have the ability to follow the game\u2019s visual style and ability to adapt to multiple styles, for all visual material produced throughout the game\u2019s development.</p><p>To thrive with us, you need to be a team player with a good ability to handle feedback and work together with different disciplines. You are self-driven, and responsible and strive to develop your skill and others constantly. It is important that you are organized and solution-oriented with the ability to tackle challenges and solve problems with a strong sense of ownership and deliver on deadlines.</p><h3><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><strong>Qualifications</strong></span></h3><p><strong>Experience: </strong>Minimum of 2 years of experience creating 2D assets with focus on mobile within the gaming or similar industry.</p><p><strong>Polishing &amp; UI Expertise:</strong>\u00a0Skilled at polishing game assets to perfection, ensuring every detail shines and aligns with the creative vision. Experienced in creating intuitive UI elements that enhance the player experience, seamlessly combining functionality with captivating design.</p><p><strong>Software skills:</strong> Strong knowledge of Photoshop. Knowledge in 3D is a big plus but not required.</p><p><strong>Portfolio:</strong> A captivating portfolio demonstrating excellent artistic ability including the effective use of color, composition, and typography.</p><p><strong>Creativity:</strong> A passion for art and a sharp eye for detail are essential, along with the ability to adapt to various art styles. Your understanding of animation will be crucial, as you\u2019ll help create assets ready for seamless animation.</p><p><strong>Passion for Gaming:</strong> A passion for video games and an understanding of what makes them visually engaging and immersive.</p><p><strong>Language: </strong>The ideal candidate will possess excellent English language skills, both in written and verbal communication, as this is essential for daily tasks and collaboration. Proficiency in Swedish is a plus but not required.</p><h3><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><strong>We offer</strong></span></h3><p>An ever-changing opportunity to explore different art styles, concepts, and themes together with highly skilled creatives in various crafts. Our project cycles are short, and you will be able to thrive in your creativity and passion by creating a range of visually stunning, unforgettable iGaming experiences.</p><p>We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees, where everyone is respected, valued, and empowered to succeed.</p><p>We work on-site at our awesome office, 2 minutes from T-Centralen in Stockholm.</p><p>Fill in an application below and please include your portfolio and CV. We will go through each application manually, without AI.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p>For the right candidate, the recruitment process includes: interviews (digitally and at our studio), as well as a work assignment. We will fill the position as soon as we have found the right candidate, so do not hesitate to submit your application as soon as possible.</p></div>","description_text":"Do you want to be part of creating fantastic, unique and entertaining iGaming experiences in a competitive global market?We are looking for a talented Game Artist with a strong passion for bringing life, entertainment and excitement to our growing games portfolio.\n\nELK is a leading developer in the iGaming industry, known for our innovative, visually stunning, and critically acclaimed game titles and IPs. We push the boundaries of gameplay and visual fidelity, setting new standards in the iGaming world.\n\nAbout the role\n\nWe take great pride in creating and offering our players a wide range of different art styles and themes in our games. As a Game Artist, you\u2019ll take on the exciting challenge of transforming early concept art into pixel-perfect final assets, while also crafting original concepts and artwork from the ground up.\n\nA typical work week as an Game Artist can consist of:\n\nAsset Creation: Craft a diverse array of high-quality 2D game assets, UI element designs and awesome, polished headlines (typography) prepared for seamless handover to our expert animators. Your sharp eye for composition, color, perspective, and lighting will be critical in ensuring the highest standard of work.\n\nPolishing Assets to Perfection with a strong focus on material definition, lighting, realism, and depth.\n\nCollaborate Across Disciplines: Work closely with other artists, animators and programmers to collaboratively build \u201cbest in class\u201d iGames.\n\nCommunication: Partner with the Art Director and Creative Director to follow the unique art style of each game. Be open to feedback and take the initiative to independently enhance and perfect your work, while still ensuring it aligns with the creative vision.\n\nInnovation: Push the boundaries of what is possible in the realms of iGames to create visually stunning and memorable experiences.\n\nWho are you?\n\nWe believe you are a passionate artist with an eye for details and the urge and ideas to make the best looking iGaming experiences ever. You are creative and innovative and aim to find solutions which maximize the game experience in relation to the technical limitations. You have the ability to follow the game\u2019s visual style and ability to adapt to multiple styles, for all visual material produced throughout the game\u2019s development.\n\nTo thrive with us, you need to be a team player with a good ability to handle feedback and work together with different disciplines. You are self-driven, and responsible and strive to develop your skill and others constantly. It is important that you are organized and solution-oriented with the ability to tackle challenges and solve problems with a strong sense of ownership and deliver on deadlines.\n\nQualifications\n\nExperience: Minimum of 2 years of experience creating 2D assets with focus on mobile within the gaming or similar industry.\n\nPolishing & UI Expertise: Skilled at polishing game assets to perfection, ensuring every detail shines and aligns with the creative vision. Experienced in creating intuitive UI elements that enhance the player experience, seamlessly combining functionality with captivating design.\n\nSoftware skills: Strong knowledge of Photoshop. Knowledge in 3D is a big plus but not required.\n\nPortfolio: A captivating portfolio demonstrating excellent artistic ability including the effective use of color, composition, and typography.\n\nCreativity: A passion for art and a sharp eye for detail are essential, along with the ability to adapt to various art styles. Your understanding of animation will be crucial, as you\u2019ll help create assets ready for seamless animation.\n\nPassion for Gaming: A passion for video games and an understanding of what makes them visually engaging and immersive.\n\nLanguage: The ideal candidate will possess excellent English language skills, both in written and verbal communication, as this is essential for daily tasks and collaboration. Proficiency in Swedish is a plus but not required.\n\nWe offer\n\nAn ever-changing opportunity to explore different art styles, concepts, and themes together with highly skilled creatives in various crafts. Our project cycles are short, and you will be able to thrive in your creativity and passion by creating a range of visually stunning, unforgettable iGaming experiences.\n\nWe are proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees, where everyone is respected, valued, and empowered to succeed.\n\nWe work on-site at our awesome office, 2 minutes from T-Centralen in Stockholm.\n\nFill in an application below and please include your portfolio and CV. We will go through each application manually, without AI.\n\nFor the right candidate, the recruitment process includes: interviews (digitally and at our studio), as well as a work assignment. We will fill the position as soon as we have found the right candidate, so do not hesitate to submit your application as soon as possible.","updated":"2026-10-01T13:52:59","start_date":"2026-11-20T22:29:19","due_date":"","location":"Vasagatan 16, 111 20 Stockholm","county":"Stockholms l\u00e4n","country":"Sweden","city":"Stockholm","tags":[],"categories":[],"image":"https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/feedback-production/jiuploads/newHeader_955_56583_20251006131140Z0IpXxEgWi.jpg","logo":null,"employment_type":null},{"id":"Loemx","job_token":"ZNvp2e","name":"Full Stack utvecklare ","business_unit_id":"7Pop","business_unit_name":"ELK Studios AB","business_unit_description":"<div><p><span style=\"color:#3498db\"><strong>About ELK Studios</strong></span></p><p><em>With a passion for games!</em></p><p><em>Since 2013, ELK Studios has passionately pushed boundaries in the online casino industry. From groundbreaking mathematics to astonishing artwork, ELK takes pride in developing entertaining mobile-first content that maximizes the experience for players around the world.</em></p></div>","link":"https://ats.talentadore.com/apply/full-stack-utvecklare/ZNvp2e","description_html":"<div><p><strong><em>ELK Studios \u00e4r en ledande spelutvecklare inom iGaming, k\u00e4nd f\u00f6r innovativa och popul\u00e4ra titlar som Pirots, Cygnus, Gold och Nitropolis-serierna. Med fokus p\u00e5 kvalitet kombinerar vi avancerad matematik, imponerande grafik och ljud i v\u00e4rldsklass. Nu s\u00f6ker vi en erfaren Full Stack Utvecklare som trivs i en varierande roll till v\u00e5r studio i centrala Stockholm. Du blir en viktig del i v\u00e5rt dynamiska och innovativa team som driver v\u00e5ra tekniska system och plattformar fram\u00e5t. Rollen \u00e4r perfekt f\u00f6r dig som gillar att ta initiativ och vill bidra med erfarenheter, utvecklas och v\u00e4xa inom programmering.\u00a0</em></strong></p><p>\u00a0</p><p>Varje spelomg\u00e5ng i ett ELK-spel startar i ECF, v\u00e5rt framework som k\u00f6rs direkt i spelarens webbl\u00e4sare. D\u00e4rifr\u00e5n g\u00e5r det vidare till v\u00e5r Go backend d\u00e4r spelresultatet ber\u00e4knas, slumptal genereras och operat\u00f6ren debiteras, innan resultatet slutligen visas p\u00e5 sk\u00e4rmen.</p><p>Vi \u00e4r ett team av skickliga utvecklare som arbetar med plattformen f\u00f6r ELK Studios alla spel. Nu s\u00f6ker vi ytterligare en erfaren Full Stack utvecklare som vill vara med och ut\u00f6ka plattformen med ny funktionalitet, bibeh\u00e5lla h\u00f6g prestanda och delta i utformningen av arkitektoniska beslut. Plattformen kombinerar bepr\u00f6vade verktyg med nya id\u00e9er fr\u00e5n och din roll kommer att vara viktigt i v\u00e5r vidareutveckling, s\u00e5 att vi kan forts\u00e4tta leverera spel i v\u00e4rldsklass.</p><p>\u00a0</p><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 152, 219);\">Om tj\u00e4nsten<strong>\u00a0</strong></span></h3><p>Hos oss f\u00e5r du en sv\u00e5rslagen bredd i din vardag, d\u00e5 du r\u00f6r dig s\u00f6ml\u00f6st fr\u00e5n h\u00f6gpresterande Go-tj\u00e4nster och kritiska wallet-API:er och frontendutveckling. Du arbetar \u00f6ver hela stacken, hur din tid f\u00f6rdelas formar vi tillsammans utifr\u00e5n dina personliga styrkor och var teamet beh\u00f6ver dig b\u00e4st just nu.</p><p><strong>Backend</strong></p><ul><li>Fatta arkitektoniska beslut som h\u00e5ller plattformen snabb, tr\u00e5ds\u00e4ker/samtidig (<em>concurrent</em>) och skalbar.</li><li>Utveckla backend-tj\u00e4nster i Go f\u00f6r system med h\u00f6ga transaktionsvolymer, till exempel: spelserver, spelladdning, spelsekvenser och spelhistorik.</li><li>Designa RESTful API:er f\u00f6r v\u00e5ra backend-tj\u00e4nster och partner integrationer.</li><li>Bygga och underh\u00e5lla wallet integrations med casino operat\u00f6rer och aggregatorer.<br>\u00a0</li></ul><p><strong>Arbeta med ECF \u2013 ELK Client Framework</strong></p><ul><li>Kontinuerlig utveckling av det ramverk som alla ELK-spel k\u00f6rs i: rendering, ljud, UI, laddningstider och spelfl\u00f6de.</li><li>Optimera prestanda f\u00f6r b\u00e5de mobil och desktop.\u00a0</li><li>Integrera spelklienten med operat\u00f6rernas plattformar via <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">postMessage</span>-gr\u00e4nssnitt.</li><li>St\u00f6tta spelutvecklare som bygger vidare p\u00e5 ramverkets API.<br>\u00a0</li></ul><p><strong>Full stack\u00a0</strong></p><ul><li>Utveckla nya och innovativa iGaming-produkter.</li><li>Anpassa plattformen efter regelverk p\u00e5 nya marknader, t.ex. insatsgr\u00e4nser, sessionsinformation och rapportering.</li><li>S\u00e4kerst\u00e4lla h\u00f6g kvalitet och leveranser i tid \u2013 hela v\u00e4gen fr\u00e5n tester till deployment och \u00f6vervakning.</li><li>Dela med dig av dina kunskaper b\u00e5de inom teamet och till andra avdelningar.</li></ul><p>\u00a0</p><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 152, 219);\">Vem \u00e4r du?\u00a0\u00a0</span></h3><p>Vi s\u00f6ker dig som har en bred teknisk grund och erfarenhet av iGaming, betall\u00f6sningar eller annan reglerad bransch. Du arbetar strukturerat med god k\u00e4nsla f\u00f6r detaljer, \u00e4r sj\u00e4lvg\u00e5ende och probleml\u00f6sande i ditt arbetss\u00e4tt, men uppskattar ocks\u00e5 ett n\u00e4ra samarbete med dina kollegor och har l\u00e4tt f\u00f6r att f\u00f6rklara tekniska koncept f\u00f6r personer utanf\u00f6r tech-teamet.</p><h3><br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 152, 219);\">Kvalifikationer\u00a0</span></h3><ul><li><strong>Minst 3 \u00e5rs</strong> <strong>erfarenhet</strong> av <span style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31);\">av programmering i Go Language</span></li><li><strong>Tech Stack: Vi arbetar i Go och JavaScript</strong> och vi f\u00f6rv\u00e4ntar oss att du ocks\u00e5 \u00e4r bekv\u00e4m med dem och ser g\u00e4rna att du beh\u00e4rskar verktygen i GNU-verktygsl\u00e5dan.\u00a0</li><li><strong>Erfarenhet av Full Stack</strong>: du k\u00e4nner dig lika trygg i backend och databaser som i browser-kod.</li></ul><ul><li>Erfarenhet av <strong>Applikationsdesign och Arkitektur</strong>\u00a0</li><li><strong>Svenska och engelska</strong>: Du beh\u00e4rskar b\u00e5da spr\u00e5ken flytande, b\u00e5de i tal och skrift\u00a0\u00a0</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31);\">Det \u00e4r meriterande om du \u00e4ven har erfarenhet av </span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31);\">Programmering i C/C++ samt system med h\u00f6ga transaktionsvolymer. </span></li><li>Erfarenhet av concurrency patterns och tr\u00e5ds\u00e4ker kod.</li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31);\">AI-assisterad kodning samt design och optimering av databasscheman, g\u00e4rna i PostgreSQL.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31);\">WebGL, Canvas eller webbaserade spelmotorer, s\u00e4rskilt g\u00e4llande mobil prestanda.</span></li></ul><p>\u00a0</p><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 152, 219);\">Vi erbjuder</span></h3><p>Vi erbjuder ett roligt och stimulerande arbete i en dynamisk och kreativ arbetsmilj\u00f6 d\u00e4r du f\u00e5r\u00a0 reellt inflytande \u00f6ver plattformens arkitektur med korta beslutsv\u00e4gar.<br>Vi \u00e4r stolta \u00f6ver att vara en arbetsgivare som v\u00e4rdes\u00e4tter m\u00e5ngfald och inkludering och som arbetar aktivt f\u00f6r att skapa en milj\u00f6 d\u00e4r alla medarbetare respekteras, v\u00e4rderas och ges m\u00f6jlighet att v\u00e4xa.P\u00e5 ELK Studios ser vi v\u00e4rdet av att utvecklas tillsammans. Vi arbetar p\u00e5 plats i v\u00e5rt ljusa kontor, i n\u00e4rheten av T-Centralen i Stockholm.</p><p>I rekryteringsprocessen ing\u00e5r f\u00f6r r\u00e4tt kandidat b\u00e5de intervjuer (digitalt och i v\u00e5r spelstudio) samt referenser. Ans\u00f6kningarna hanteras l\u00f6pande, s\u00e5 v\u00e4nta inte med att s\u00f6ka.</p><p>Varmt v\u00e4lkommen med din ans\u00f6kan!</p></div>","description_text":"ELK Studios \u00e4r en ledande spelutvecklare inom iGaming, k\u00e4nd f\u00f6r innovativa och popul\u00e4ra titlar som Pirots, Cygnus, Gold och Nitropolis-serierna. Med fokus p\u00e5 kvalitet kombinerar vi avancerad matematik, imponerande grafik och ljud i v\u00e4rldsklass. Nu s\u00f6ker vi en erfaren Full Stack Utvecklare som trivs i en varierande roll till v\u00e5r studio i centrala Stockholm. Du blir en viktig del i v\u00e5rt dynamiska och innovativa team som driver v\u00e5ra tekniska system och plattformar fram\u00e5t. Rollen \u00e4r perfekt f\u00f6r dig som gillar att ta initiativ och vill bidra med erfarenheter, utvecklas och v\u00e4xa inom programmering.\n\n\n\nVarje spelomg\u00e5ng i ett ELK-spel startar i ECF, v\u00e5rt framework som k\u00f6rs direkt i spelarens webbl\u00e4sare. D\u00e4rifr\u00e5n g\u00e5r det vidare till v\u00e5r Go backend d\u00e4r spelresultatet ber\u00e4knas, slumptal genereras och operat\u00f6ren debiteras, innan resultatet slutligen visas p\u00e5 sk\u00e4rmen.\n\nVi \u00e4r ett team av skickliga utvecklare som arbetar med plattformen f\u00f6r ELK Studios alla spel. Nu s\u00f6ker vi ytterligare en erfaren Full Stack utvecklare som vill vara med och ut\u00f6ka plattformen med ny funktionalitet, bibeh\u00e5lla h\u00f6g prestanda och delta i utformningen av arkitektoniska beslut. Plattformen kombinerar bepr\u00f6vade verktyg med nya id\u00e9er fr\u00e5n och din roll kommer att vara viktigt i v\u00e5r vidareutveckling, s\u00e5 att vi kan forts\u00e4tta leverera spel i v\u00e4rldsklass.\n\n\n\nOm tj\u00e4nsten\n\nHos oss f\u00e5r du en sv\u00e5rslagen bredd i din vardag, d\u00e5 du r\u00f6r dig s\u00f6ml\u00f6st fr\u00e5n h\u00f6gpresterande Go-tj\u00e4nster och kritiska wallet-API:er och frontendutveckling. Du arbetar \u00f6ver hela stacken, hur din tid f\u00f6rdelas formar vi tillsammans utifr\u00e5n dina personliga styrkor och var teamet beh\u00f6ver dig b\u00e4st just nu.\n\nBackend\n\n- Fatta arkitektoniska beslut som h\u00e5ller plattformen snabb, tr\u00e5ds\u00e4ker/samtidig (concurrent) och skalbar.\n\n- Utveckla backend-tj\u00e4nster i Go f\u00f6r system med h\u00f6ga transaktionsvolymer, till exempel: spelserver, spelladdning, spelsekvenser och spelhistorik.\n\n- Designa RESTful API:er f\u00f6r v\u00e5ra backend-tj\u00e4nster och partner integrationer.\n\n- Bygga och underh\u00e5lla wallet integrations med casino operat\u00f6rer och aggregatorer.\n\n\nArbeta med ECF \u2013 ELK Client Framework\n\n- Kontinuerlig utveckling av det ramverk som alla ELK-spel k\u00f6rs i: rendering, ljud, UI, laddningstider och spelfl\u00f6de.\n\n- Optimera prestanda f\u00f6r b\u00e5de mobil och desktop.\n\n- Integrera spelklienten med operat\u00f6rernas plattformar via postMessage-gr\u00e4nssnitt.\n\n- St\u00f6tta spelutvecklare som bygger vidare p\u00e5 ramverkets API.\n\n\nFull stack\n\n- Utveckla nya och innovativa iGaming-produkter.\n\n- Anpassa plattformen efter regelverk p\u00e5 nya marknader, t.ex. insatsgr\u00e4nser, sessionsinformation och rapportering.\n\n- S\u00e4kerst\u00e4lla h\u00f6g kvalitet och leveranser i tid \u2013 hela v\u00e4gen fr\u00e5n tester till deployment och \u00f6vervakning.\n\n- Dela med dig av dina kunskaper b\u00e5de inom teamet och till andra avdelningar.\n\n\n\nVem \u00e4r du?\n\nVi s\u00f6ker dig som har en bred teknisk grund och erfarenhet av iGaming, betall\u00f6sningar eller annan reglerad bransch. Du arbetar strukturerat med god k\u00e4nsla f\u00f6r detaljer, \u00e4r sj\u00e4lvg\u00e5ende och probleml\u00f6sande i ditt arbetss\u00e4tt, men uppskattar ocks\u00e5 ett n\u00e4ra samarbete med dina kollegor och har l\u00e4tt f\u00f6r att f\u00f6rklara tekniska koncept f\u00f6r personer utanf\u00f6r tech-teamet.\n\n\nKvalifikationer\n\n- Minst 3 \u00e5rs erfarenhet av av programmering i Go Language\n\n- Tech Stack: Vi arbetar i Go och JavaScript och vi f\u00f6rv\u00e4ntar oss att du ocks\u00e5 \u00e4r bekv\u00e4m med dem och ser g\u00e4rna att du beh\u00e4rskar verktygen i GNU-verktygsl\u00e5dan.\n\n- Erfarenhet av Full Stack: du k\u00e4nner dig lika trygg i backend och databaser som i browser-kod.\n\n- Erfarenhet av Applikationsdesign och Arkitektur\n\n- Svenska och engelska: Du beh\u00e4rskar b\u00e5da spr\u00e5ken flytande, b\u00e5de i tal och skrift\n\nDet \u00e4r meriterande om du \u00e4ven har erfarenhet av\n\n- Programmering i C/C++ samt system med h\u00f6ga transaktionsvolymer.\n\n- Erfarenhet av concurrency patterns och tr\u00e5ds\u00e4ker kod.\n\n- AI-assisterad kodning samt design och optimering av databasscheman, g\u00e4rna i PostgreSQL.\n\n- WebGL, Canvas eller webbaserade spelmotorer, s\u00e4rskilt g\u00e4llande mobil prestanda.\n\n\n\nVi erbjuder\n\nVi erbjuder ett roligt och stimulerande arbete i en dynamisk och kreativ arbetsmilj\u00f6 d\u00e4r du f\u00e5r reellt inflytande \u00f6ver plattformens arkitektur med korta beslutsv\u00e4gar.\nVi \u00e4r stolta \u00f6ver att vara en arbetsgivare som v\u00e4rdes\u00e4tter m\u00e5ngfald och inkludering och som arbetar aktivt f\u00f6r att skapa en milj\u00f6 d\u00e4r alla medarbetare respekteras, v\u00e4rderas och ges m\u00f6jlighet att v\u00e4xa.P\u00e5 ELK Studios ser vi v\u00e4rdet av att utvecklas tillsammans. Vi arbetar p\u00e5 plats i v\u00e5rt ljusa kontor, i n\u00e4rheten av T-Centralen i Stockholm.\n\nI rekryteringsprocessen ing\u00e5r f\u00f6r r\u00e4tt kandidat b\u00e5de intervjuer (digitalt och i v\u00e5r spelstudio) samt referenser. Ans\u00f6kningarna hanteras l\u00f6pande, s\u00e5 v\u00e4nta inte med att s\u00f6ka.\n\nVarmt v\u00e4lkommen med din ans\u00f6kan!","updated":"2026-11-11T12:15:43","start_date":"2026-10-28T15:46:00","due_date":"","location":"Vasagatan 16, 111 20 Stockholm","county":"","country":"Sweden","city":"Stockholm","tags":[],"categories":[],"image":"https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/feedback-production/jiuploads/header-image_955_56580_202611020804200zv8ikWxNA.jpg","logo":null,"employment_type":""}]}